# It's All Too Much, refrain (figure 160.1)
# Tune and middle voice over a G pedal. Each bar is typed in two halves; the tune's D B A G fill the
# second half of bar 3 as eighths. The middle voice's B meets the tune's B in unison (bar 2, bar 4).
#? Register: tune and middle at sung pitch (E4 down to G3); they may be meant an octave higher.
key G

